reference_screenshots/
  Frames from three YouTube films ("DISCIPLINE – An Animated Short Film",
  "LUST VS LOVE Part 11 Finale – An Animated Short Film", "Motivation Will
  Fail You"). Copyright belongs to their original creators. Included only as
  private study references for analysing structure and style. Do not
  redistribute, re-upload, or use them (or their characters, scripts or
  lines) in published videos.

